    "top_module": {
      "name": "adaptive_aero_control_top",
      "description": "Top-level FPGA wrapper that provides firmware-visible control/status registers, request packaging, response validation, timeout supervision, safe fallback arbitration, and final bounded actuator command generation. It is the only top-level design entry point and must expose the model transport, cfg_bus, status bits, and actuator command outputs with real RTL drivers. It may instantiate internal control, transport, monitor, and safety-guard submodules, but it does not implement the surrogate model itself.",
